{"sourceUrl":"https://smjgs.seu.edu.cn/2026/0710/c8471a576384/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:43.487827+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://smjgs.seu.edu.cn/2026/0710/c8471a576384/page.htm","html":"<div><div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>根据学校</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生工作部署，制订本学院具体工作方案并通知如下。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、学院概况</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>东南大学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span>蒙纳士大学（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>Monash University</span></span><span><span><span>）国际学院（苏州）（以下简称国际学院）的前身是东南大学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span>蒙纳士大学苏州联合研究生院，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>月更名为国际学院。她是教育部批准设立的我国第一所中外联合研究生院，许可证编号：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>MOE32AUA02DNR20121197N</span></span><span><span><span>，办学地点：江苏省苏州市独墅湖科教创新区。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>国际学院以服务地方经济发展为导向，围绕苏州市主导产业开设</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span><span>个全英文授课硕士专业（方向）：国际商务、英语笔译、计算机技术、人工智能、电子信息（含健康数据科学、新一代电子信息技术）、机械（含智能制造、工业设计）、材料与化工（含材料工程、功能材料与绿色化工）、能源动力、电气工程、土木水利、生物与医药、交通运输。苏州联合研究生院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2015</span></span><span><span><span>年通过教育部中外合作办学质量评估，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2016</span></span><span><span><span>年进入“江苏高校中外合作办学高水平示范性建设工程”首批机构行列并于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2020</span></span><span><span><span>年通过验收。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>在本科学校可取得推荐免试研究生资格</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无有违学术道德等行为</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>身心健康</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>满足以下英语水平要求之一</strong></span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2024</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>月（含）之后取得的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span><span>总成绩不低于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>6.0</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span>总成绩不低于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>450</span></span><span><span><span>分（报考英语笔译专业的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span>总成绩不低于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>500</span></span><span><span><span>分）；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TEM-8</span></span><span><span><span>合格</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span><span>申请推免时满足</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TEM-4</span></span><span><span><span>良好，但正式进入</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>EDP</span></span><span><span><span>课程学习时须具备</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TEM-8</span></span><span><span><span>合格成绩</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL Paper Edition</span></span><span><span><span>总成绩不低于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>69</span></span><span><span><span>分；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>Pearson Test of Academic English</span></span><span><span><span>总成绩不低于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>50</span></span><span><span><span>分。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>如对英语水平要求有疑问，请咨询蒙纳士大学学生事务处</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>电话：</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>0512-62997902 </strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>邮箱：</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>sz-saservice@monash.edu</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、申请者报名</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>．系统报名要求</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）登录东南大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"http://gsas.seu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://gsas.seu.edu.cn</a></span></span><span><span><span>，以下简称“系统”），选择“接收推荐免试研究生”项目。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>）报名时间</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>各专业</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>/</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>方向报名时间如下</strong></span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>培养学院</strong></span></span